{{!-- context: recipientName, platformName, rejectionReason (optional) --}}
<p style="margin:0 0 8px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.5;color:#6b7280;">Hi {{recipientName}},</p>
<p style="margin:0 0 16px;font-size:22px;font-weight:800;line-height:1.25;color:#111827;letter-spacing:-0.02em;">
  Thank you for your interest in joining {{platformName}}! 💜
</p>
<p style="margin:0 0 16px;font-size:16px;line-height:1.6;color:#374151;">
  We appreciate the time and effort you've put into applying to become part of our creator community.
</p>
<p style="margin:0 0 16px;font-size:16px;line-height:1.6;color:#374151;">
  After carefully reviewing your profile, we're unable to approve your application at this time.
</p>
{{#if rejectionReason}}
<div style="margin:0 0 20px;padding:14px 16px;background:#fff7ed;border:2px solid #111827;border-radius:12px;">
  <p style="margin:0 0 6px;font-size:13px;font-weight:700;color:#111827;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:0.04em;">Note from our team 📝</p>
  <p style="margin:0;font-size:14px;line-height:1.55;color:#374151;">{{rejectionReason}}</p>
</div>
{{/if}}
<p style="margin:0 0 16px;font-size:16px;line-height:1.6;color:#374151;">
  At {{platformName}}, we aim to build a community of creators whose content quality, creativity, profile activity, and overall engagement align with the expectations of our brand partners.
</p>
<p style="margin:0 0 16px;font-size:16px;line-height:1.6;color:#374151;">
  While your profile may not meet all our current selection criteria, this doesn't mean your creator journey ends here!
</p>
<p style="margin:0 0 16px;font-size:16px;line-height:1.6;color:#374151;">
  The good news? You can reapply after 3 months! ✨
</p>
<p style="margin:0 0 16px;font-size:16px;line-height:1.6;color:#374151;">
  In the meantime, we encourage you to:
</p>
<ul style="margin:0 0 16px;padding-left:20px;font-size:16px;line-height:1.6;color:#374151;">
  <li style="margin:0 0 6px;">Keep creating original, high-quality content.</li>
  <li style="margin:0 0 6px;">Stay consistent with your posts and reels.</li>
  <li style="margin:0 0 6px;">Focus on building genuine audience engagement.</li>
  <li style="margin:0 0 6px;">Improve your content presentation and storytelling.</li>
</ul>
<p style="margin:0 0 16px;font-size:16px;line-height:1.6;color:#374151;">
  We believe creativity grows with experience, and we'd love to see how your content evolves.
</p>
<p style="margin:0 0 16px;font-size:16px;line-height:1.6;color:#374151;">
  Thank you again for choosing {{platformName}}. We look forward to reviewing your application again in the future!
</p>
<p style="margin:0 0 12px;font-size:14px;line-height:1.5;color:#6b7280;">
  Best regards,<br />Team {{platformName}}<br />Create. Connect. Collaborate.
</p>
